      "page": 531,
      "ruku": 466,
      "hizbQuarter": 213,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4906,
      "text": "The sun and the moon follow their precise courses,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 55,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّحۡمَٰن",
        "englishName": "Ar-Rahmaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Beneficent",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 531,
      "ruku": 466,
      "hizbQuarter": 213,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4907,
      "text": "and the stars[1] and trees prostrate [to Allah][2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 55,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّحۡمَٰن",
        "englishName": "Ar-Rahmaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Beneficent",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 531,
      "ruku": 466,
      "hizbQuarter": 213,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4908,
      "text": "He raised the heaven and enjoined justice",
      "surah": {
        "number": 55,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّحۡمَٰن",
        "englishName": "Ar-Rahmaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Beneficent",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 531,
      "ruku": 466,
      "hizbQuarter": 213,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4909,
      "text": "so that you may not transgress the limits of justice.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 55,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّحۡمَٰن",
        "englishName": "Ar-Rahmaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Beneficent",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 531,
      "ruku": 466,
      "hizbQuarter": 213,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4910,
      "text": "Therefore establish weights in justice, and do not give short measure.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 55,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّحۡمَٰن",
        "englishName": "Ar-Rahmaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Beneficent",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 531,
      "ruku": 466,
      "hizbQuarter": 213,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4911,
      "text": "He has spread out the earth for all creatures,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 55,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّحۡمَٰن",
        "englishName": "Ar-Rahmaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Beneficent",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 531,
      "ruku": 466,
      "hizbQuarter": 213,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4912,
      "text": "in which there are fruits and palm trees with date stalks,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 55,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّحۡمَٰن",
        "englishName": "Ar-Rahmaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Beneficent",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 531,
      "ruku": 466,
      "hizbQuarter": 213,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4913,
      "text": "and grain having chaff, and fragrant plants.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 55,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرَّحۡمَٰن",
        "englishName": "Ar-Rahmaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Beneficent",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 531,
      "ruku": 466,
      "hizbQuarter": 213,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4914,
      "text": "Then which of the favors of your Lord will you[3] deny?",
